{%- comment -%}
  The four facts that decide whether someone can order at all. They appear
  under the hero and again on the week page, because a customer who lands
  straight on a week page needs them just as much.
{%- endcomment -%}
<div class="wrap facts">
  <p class="fact">{% render 'icon', icon: 'scissors' %} Cut Tuesday &amp; Friday</p>
  <p class="fact">{% render 'icon', icon: 'clock' %} Order by Mon 18:00</p>
  <p class="fact">{% render 'icon', icon: 'van' %} Fife &amp; Edinburgh van delivery</p>
  <p class="fact">{% render 'icon', icon: 'parcel' %} UK courier (selected flowers)</p>
</div>
